[99.594251, "i", "cat > /app/ipython/notes_for_testing.txt << 'EOF'\n# IPython Library - Notes for Fuzz Testing\n\n## Overview\nIPython is an interactive Python shell with enhanced features for computing.\n\n## Key Functions for Fuzzing\n\n### 1. IPython.core.inputtransformer2\n- Location: IPython/core/inputtransformer2.py\n- Transforms input before execution\n- Handles magic commands, shell escapes\n\n### 2. IPython.core.guarded_eval\n- Location: IPython/core/guarded_eval.py\n- Safe evaluation of expressions\n- Used for tab completion\n\n### 3. IPython.core.completer\n- Location: IPython/core/completer.py\n- Tab completion logic\n- Parses partial Python expressions\n\n### 4. IPython.core.prefilter\n- Location: IPython/core/prefilter.py\n- Prefilters input lines\n\n## Fuzzing Strategy\n- Focus on input transformation functions\n- Test guarded_eval with various expressions\n- Test completer with partial/malformed code\n- Test magic command parsing\n\n## Dependencies\n- decorator\n- jedi\n- matplotlib-inline\n- pexpect\n- prompt_toolkit\n- pygments\n- stack_data\n- tra"]
[99.594306, "i", "itlets\nEOF\n"]
