[99.79439, "i", "cat > /app/minisgl/notes_for_testing.txt << 'EOF'\n# MiniSGL Library - Notes for Fuzz Testing\n\n## Overview\nMini-SGLang is a lightweight LLM inference framework (~5000 lines of Python).\n\n## Key Functions for Fuzzing\n\n### 1. Tokenizer\n- Location: python/minisgl/tokenizer/\n- Handles text tokenization for LLMs\n- Input processing for models\n\n### 2. Message handling\n- Location: python/minisgl/message/\n- Processes chat messages and prompts\n\n### 3. Engine configuration\n- Location: python/minisgl/engine/config.py\n- Parses configuration options\n\n### 4. Request handling\n- Location: python/minisgl/server/\n- HTTP request parsing\n\n## Fuzzing Strategy\n- Focus on tokenizer with random text inputs\n- Test message formatting functions\n- Test configuration parsing\n- Test request/response handling\n\n## Dependencies\n- torch\n- transformers\n- numpy\n- fastapi (for server)\nEOF\n"]
